        "publication": "The native host dispatcher receives the captured event after the supplied source connection outer commit, or immediately when that connection has no active transaction.",
        "rollback": "Callbacks attach to the matching native connection and current nesting record; native outer/savepoint rollback discards the corresponding callbacks.",
