        "host_policy": "Host after-commit listeners and queue after_commit policies can add their own deferral after publication. Host transaction infrastructure and dispatcher bindings are preserved.",
        "delivery_limit": "Local callbacks are not an outbox. Process exit between commit and callback can lose delivery; no crash durability or exactly-once delivery is promised.",
